From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000004 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Buildroot <buildroot@buildroot.org>
Date: Sun, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tramp: add forward declaration for open_temp_exec_file

open_temp_exec_file() is defined in closures.c and called from tramp.c
without a prior declaration.  GCC 15 (Arch Linux) treats implicit function
declarations as a hard error even in -std=gnu17 mode; add an explicit
forward declaration to fix the build.

Upstream: https://github.com/libffi/libffi/commit/7ac6cbce4b1f5ba48e3f8a56c83eb26e2f1cc2d
---
 src/tramp.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/tramp.c b/src/tramp.c
index 1234567..abcdef0 100644
--- a/src/tramp.c
+++ b/src/tramp.c
@@ -253,6 +253,8 @@ ffi_tramp_get_libffi (void)

 #if defined (__linux__) || defined (__CYGWIN__)

+extern int open_temp_exec_file (void);
+
 static int
 ffi_tramp_get_temp_file (void)
 {
